# Frame_RunWorld's free-camera branch ($009BEA Frame_RunFreeCam: jmp Debug_FreeCamStep): no real
# state sets g_FreeCam ($F4F1; its one writer Debug_PauseMenu runs only while g_DebugPause, which
# only ever gets 0). Ruling 5 (2): at its own first call, g_FreeCam set, pad 1's live record idle.

case freecam
b $FFFFF4F1 = $FF
w $FFFFF418 = $F62C
b $FFFFF62C = 0
b $FFFFF62E = 0
l $FFFFDFC0 = 0
l $FFFFF41A = [$FFFFDFC4] + $00A00000
l $FFFFF41E = [$FFFFDFC8] + $00700000
